{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/the-military-division-of-the-kings-birthday-honours-list-2026","content_id":"211fe120-ab52-4eab-9307-5c388dcd75bc","description":"A number of military personnel have been granted state honours in the King’s Birthday Honours list for their work in the Armed Forces.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><h2 id=\"royal-navy-awards\">Royal Navy Awards</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"promotions-in-and-appointments-to-the-military-division-of-the-most-excellent-order-of-the-british-empire\">Promotions in and appointments to the military division of the most excellent order of the British Empire</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-knight-commander\">As Knight Commander</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Vice Admiral Andrew Jeffery KYTE CB</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"promotions-in-and-appointments-to-the-military-division-of-the-most-honourable-order-of-the-bath\">Promotions in and appointments to the military division of the most honourable order of the Bath</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-companions\">As Companions</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Rear Admiral Robert Alexander LAUCHLAN</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major General Paul Patrick LYNCH MC, Royal Marines</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Rear Admiral Christopher SHEPHERD</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"promotions-in-and-appointments-to-the-military-division-of-the-most-excellent-order-of-the-british-empire-1\">Promotions in and appointments to the military division of the most excellent order of the British Empire</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-commanders\">As Commanders</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Captain Adrian COGHILL</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Rear Admiral Daniel D’SILVA</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Commodore David M FILTNESS</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-officers\">As Officers</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Captain Philip BURGESS</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Commander Benjamin Robert DORRINGTON</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Commander James Alexander Grant McBRATNEY</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Commander James Edward MITCHELL</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Commander Benjamin SMITH</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Captain Keith James MacFarlane STEPHENSON</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-members\">As Members</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Commander Aaron COATES</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Commander Phoebe Harriet HALL</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Rupert Henry JOHNSTONE-BURT</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Adam LAPPIN, Royal Naval Reserve</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Warrant Officer 1 (Logistics) (Police) Dean LATHAM</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant (Sea Cadet Corps) Joshua MCDERMOTT</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Warrant Officer 2 (Warfare) (Electronic Warfare) William PENRIC</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Commander Adam Maxwell PREVETT</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Warrant Officer 1 Logistics (Supply Chain) Lee REEVES</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Commander Michael RYDIARD</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"royal-red-cross\">Royal Red Cross</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-an-ordinary-member-of-the-royal-red-cross-first-class\">As an Ordinary Member of the Royal Red Cross, First Class</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Chief Petty Officer Laura Jane FALLON ARRC, Queen Alexandra’s Royal Naval Nursing Service</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-an-ordinary-associate-of-the-royal-red-cross-second-class\">As an Ordinary Associate of the Royal Red Cross, Second Class</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Lieutenant Megan Joyce MUIRHEAD, Queen Alexandra’s Royal Naval Nursing Service</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"kings-volunteer-reserves-medal\">King’s Volunteer Reserves Medal</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Warrant Officer 2 Robert COOPER, Royal Marines Reserve</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"kings-commendation-for-valuable-service\">King’s Commendation for Valuable Service</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Commander Glyn Terence DUFFELL</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Commander Mathew GEE</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Jake Alexander ROBERTSON</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Commander Anya C SHEPHERD</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"army-awards\">Army Awards</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"promotions-in-and-appointments-to-the-military-division-of-the-most-excellent-order-of-the-british-empire-2\">Promotions in and appointments to the military division of the most excellent order of the British Empire</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-knight-commander-1\">As Knight Commander</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Lieutenant General Simon Peter HAMILTON CBE</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"promotions-in-and-appointments-to-the-military-division-of-the-most-honourable-order-of-the-bath-1\">Promotions in and appointments to the military division of the most honourable order of the Bath</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-companions-1\">As Companions</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major General Elizabeth Jane FAITHFULL-DAVIES CBE</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major General Samuel Leslie HUMPHRIS MBE</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"promotions-in-and-appointments-to-the-military-division-of-the-most-excellent-order-of-the-british-empire-3\">Promotions in and appointments to the military division of the most excellent order of the British Empire</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-commanders-1\">As Commanders</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Brigadier Richard Stewart Charles BELL</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Colonel Simon D’Olier DUCKWORTH OBE DL, Army Reserve</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Colonel Ross Henzell NOOTT</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Brigadier Peter Thomas QUAITE OBE</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-officers-1\">As Officers</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Michael James BRIGHAM MBE, The Mercian Regiment</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Colonel David Robertson DUNCAN</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Colonel Peter James HALE</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Colonel Thomas Edward KELLY</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Colonel Oliver Peter LEES, Royal Corps of Signals</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Colonel Iain James LOGAN, Intelligence Corps</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Colonel Thomas David Holroyd OAKLEY, Irish Guards</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Colonel David John ROBINSON</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Colonel Toby Patrick Oughtred TILL MBE</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Colonel Jonathan Mark WILSON TD VR, Army Reserve</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-members-1\">As Members</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Captain Kayleigh Sandra Hannah BAKER, Adjutant General’s Corps (Educational and Training Services Branch)</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Captain Andy Ananda BALWAH, Royal Army Physical Training Corps</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Warrant Officer Class 2 James Michael BECK, Royal Corps of Signals</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major James David BURBIDGE, Corps of Royal Engineers</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Daniel Brian Louis COLE, The Princess of Wales’s Royal Regiment</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Sergeant Perry Gordon COOK, Corps of Royal Electrical and Mechanical Engineers</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Warrant Officer Class 2 Adam Jeffrey David DETHERIDGE, The Royal Logistic Corps</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Thomas James DOYLE, Corps of Royal Engineers</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Staff Sergeant Jack Gary EDWARDS, Royal Corps of Signals</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Captain Noel EGUASI-ACQUAH, Adjutant General’s Corps (Staff and Personnel Support Branch)</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Thomas Fraser FORTUNE, The Royal Regiment of Scotland</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Carol Ann GALLAGHER, Intelligence Corps, Army Reserve</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Warrant Officer Class 1 Jason Lionel HARTLAND, The Queen’s Royal Hussars</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Kieran James HATCHLEY, The King’s Royal Hussars</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Mark Alan HAYWARD, The Rifles</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Colonel Robin HICKS, The Princess of Wales’s Royal Regiment</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Michael Ian Morris HOWDEN, Intelligence Corps</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Corporal Steven HUME, The Royal Regiment of Scotland</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Corporal Matthew Robert JONES, Intelligence Corps</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Colonel Stuart Alan KEEGAN, VR, The Royal Wessex Yeomanry, Army Reserve</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Captain George Sackville LANE FOX, The Blues and Royals (Royal Horse Guards and 1st Dragoons)</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Captain Simon David MIDDLETON, Royal Regiment of Artillery</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Owen George MITCHELL, The Rifles</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Luke Francis MORAN, Army Air Corps</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Colonel Brian Anthony O’NEILL, The Royal Regiment of Scotland</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major John Richard O’NEILL, Adjutant General’s Corps (Royal Military Police)</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Alexandra Elizabeth PETHERBRIDGE, The Royal Logistic Corps</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Colonel Anthony Derek PICK, Corps of Royal Engineers</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Captain Steven Joseph RASBURN, Intelligence Corps</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Stuart David ROBINSON VR, Intelligence Corps, Army Reserve</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Thomas Edward RUTHERFORD, The Royal Regiment of Fusiliers</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Mark James SAUNDERS, Corps of Royal Electrical and Mechanical Engineers</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Andrew James Patrick SHANNON, The Royal Logistic Corps</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Alexander John Piers SHIRREFF, Grenadier Guards</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Glen SMITH, Adjutant General’s Corps (Staff and Personnel Support Branch)</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Colonel Hannah Mary TAYLOR, Royal Army Medical Service</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Richard Matthew WALL, The Royal Corps of Signals</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Tobias WHITMARSH, The Royal Irish Regiment</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Karl WOODSIDE, The Royal Logistic Corps</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"royal-red-cross-1\">Royal Red Cross</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-an-ordinary-member-of-the-royal-red-cross-first-class-1\">As an Ordinary Member of the Royal Red Cross, First Class</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Lieutenant Colonel David John JENKINS, Royal Army Medical Service</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-an-ordinary-associate-of-the-royal-red-cross-second-class-1\">As an Ordinary Associate of the Royal Red Cross, Second Class</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Staff Sergeant Natasha SINCLAIR, Royal Army Medical Service</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"kings-volunteer-reserves-medal-1\">King’s Volunteer Reserves Medal</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Colonel Lex AGATHANGELOU VR, Army Reserve</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Richard Patrick ALLMAN VR, General List, Army Reserve</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Lieutenant Colonel Eric Mark BELLEW VR, Royal Army Medical Service, Army Reserve</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Ian Macdonald BUNCE VR, The Royal Regiment of Scotland, Army Reserve</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"kings-commendation-for-valuable-service-1\">King’s Commendation for Valuable Service</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Warrant Officer Class 2 Darren James FOWLER, The Royal Signals</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Christopher James Meyrick LLOYD, The Mercian Regiment</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Captain David Matthew RECHNER, The Royal Army Medical Service</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Major Oliver Graham ROSTRON, Irish Guards</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"non-operational-gallantry\">Non-Operational Gallantry</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"kings-gallantry-medal\">King’s Gallantry Medal</h3>\n\n<p>Sapper Alex APPLEBY-MASON, The Royal Engineers, Army Reserve</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"kings-commendation-for-bravery\">King’s Commendation for Bravery</h3>\n\n<p>Corporal James Kirkby BARK, Adjutant General’s Corps (Royal Military Police)</p>\n\n<p>Lance Corporal Kieron Edward BUCHAN, The Corps of Royal Electrical and Mechanical Engineers</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"royal-air-force-awards\">Royal Air Force Awards</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"promotions-in-and-appointments-to-the-military-division-of-the-most-excellent-order-of-the-british-empire-4\">Promotions in and appointments to the military division of the most excellent order of the British Empire</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-knight-commander-2\">As Knight Commander</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Air Marshal Paul Harron LLOYD CBE</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"promotions-in-and-appointments-to-the-military-division-of-the-most-honourable-order-of-the-bath-2\">Promotions in and appointments to the military division of the most honourable order of the Bath</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-companions-2\">As Companions</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Air Vice-Marshal Jeremy John ATTRIDGE OBE</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Air Vice-Marshal Michael John SMEATH CBE</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"promotions-in-and-appointments-to-the-military-division-of-the-most-excellent-order-of-the-british-empire-5\">Promotions in and appointments to the military division of the most excellent order of the British Empire</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-commanders-2\">As Commanders</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Air Commodore Richard FOGDEN</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Air Vice-Marshal Andrew Timothy MARTIN OBE</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Air Commodore Claire Hazel O’GRADY</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-officers-2\">As Officers</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Group Captain Alexander Nelson BENNETT</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Wing Commander Keith John BISSETT</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Group Captain James BROOKS</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Group Captain Richard Charles CAMERON</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Wing Commander Julian Patrick Leslie DE VAL</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Group Captain Nicola Jayne DUNCAN</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Wing Commander Sarah Michelle TUNSTALL</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-members-2\">As Members</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Squadron Leader Richard Peter George ALLISON</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Corporal Bethany Anne ANDREWS</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Master Aircrew Christopher James BRADBURY</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Warrant Officer Richard Anthony GRIMSHAW-ELSE</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Flight Lieutenant James David HOBKIRK</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Flying Officer Graeme William Alexander HUGHES</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Flight Lieutenant Paul MEDFORD</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Warrant Officer Murugesvaran SUBRAMANIAM</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Squadron Leader Kris TURNER</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Master Aircrew Peter Richard WELSH</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Squadron Leader Daniel John WILKES</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Corporal Kirsty YOULE</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"royal-red-cross-2\">Royal Red Cross</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"as-an-ordinary-associate-of-the-royal-red-cross-second-class-2\">As an Ordinary Associate of the Royal Red Cross, Second Class</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Flight Lieutenant Neill Louis CORDINGLEY</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Warrant Officer Kay Rebecca WARD</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"kings-volunteer-reserves-medal-2\">King’s Volunteer Reserves Medal</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Wing Commander Brian Mark COLLIGAN</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Air Specialist (Class 1) David John GOODWIN</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"kings-commendation-for-valuable-service-2\">King’s Commendation for Valuable Service</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>\n    <p>Squadron Leader Michael James William BROWNE</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Group Captain Kevin Jeffrey TERRETT OBE</p>\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <p>Squadron Leader Lewis James TRAVERS</p>\n  </li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 id=\"non-operational-gallantry-1\">Non-Operational Gallantry</h3>\n\n<h3 id=\"kings-gallantry-medal-1\">King’s Gallantry Medal</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Air Specialist (Class 1) George KARNOVSKI</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 id=\"civilian-awards\">Civilian Awards</h2>\n\n<h3 id=\"kings-commendation-for-valuable-service-3\">King’s Commendation for Valuable Service</h3>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Mr Jonathan Walsh, Civil Servant</li>\n</ul>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-12T21:30:00Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["d994e55c-48c9-4795-b872-58d8ec98af12"],"images":[{"caption":null,"content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46e90e0731ae2a1415/s216_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d468fa8f5346732690e/s300_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d468fa8f53468995326/s465_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46e90e0731a983a846/s630_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46e90e0731a4dcff75/s712_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/63495d46d3bf7f618eda94d2/s960_ministry-of-defence-building.jpg"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"news_story","first_published_at":"2026-06-12T22:30:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/the-military-division-of-the-kings-birthday-honours-list-2026","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/the-military-division-of-the-kings-birthday-honours-list-2026","base_path":"/government/news/the-military-division-of-the-kings-birthday-honours-list-2026","content_id":"211fe120-ab52-4eab-9307-5c388dcd75bc","document_type":"news_story","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-06-12T21:30:00Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"The Military division of The King's Birthday Honours List 2026","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/the-military-division-of-the-kings-birthday-honours-list-2026","withdrawn":false}],"emphasised_organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D17","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","base_path":"/government/organisations/ministry-of-defence","content_id":"d994e55c-48c9-4795-b872-58d8ec98af12","details":{"acronym":"MOD","brand":"minist